- **Feels:** Happiness 3 (baseline still absence-grounded [7e586ddb5d81]), anxiety 5 spiking at one o'clock [0848d3ee5eab], disgust 5 at deniable words with a gravy boat [0642cb0bdb6c], anger cooling to 3, sadness 4, affection holding at 7, loneliness down to 3.

